<title>RUSSIA: Russian PPI quickens to 2.1 pct monthly in Aug.</title>
<headline>Russian PPI quickens to 2.1 pct monthly in Aug.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian monthly industrial prices rose 2.1 percent in August after 1.2 percent in July, the State Statistics Committee said on Friday.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN INDUSTRIAL PRICES  AUG 96    JUL 96    AUG 95</p>
<p>    Month-on-month pct change    +2.1	+1.2	+6.8</p>
<p>    Year-on-year pct change     +36.5     +42.7    +254.7</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
